  "repair_or_experiment_note": "Repaired an E2 metadata reader that rejected valid actor-before-step calls on the same source line. The new reader compares source line and column while preserving exact counts, original SDK/RSL proofs, worker and Task ABI. Original231 metadata failure, source-generation errors and all original files remain. V2 removes automatic metadata-child signals; V3 links new reader/expected hashes without changing the policy or physics.\n\nActual new E2 evaluation restored the frozen42822/Adam859300 policy and original400N50D0-D7, passed metadata/CUDA restore/native24, then completed20k environments x1200 controls/24s with actor/critic/STD/optimizer unchanged. The parent remains false because a post-App.close read-count artifact was absent; workerwait0, complete bounded report and all-owned resource releases are retained. No replay was performed for that marker.\n\nOriginal sameUID complete-cycle facts:53140 complete spans,52588 false and552 within the original nonterminal bounds. A separately frozen necessary one-pass read of the new93.7MB producer JSONL verified the same byte/hash/row stream. Along-speed failures46147 dominate;cross9099/yaw8413 overlap. These are event counts, not an independent population success rate, and identify tracking deficits without proving a unique cause. No new aggregate gate, reward, force, state injection or training update was introduced.\n\nAlso appends the original227D W35 closure without retagging227:77newPPO/36.96M transitions,qualified181-finite-tensor final32481/Adam651260,deadline met,one original fee3645.0908699035645SUMONCE,all owned processes out/locksfree/currentCNone. Source-only action mapping review and all static unknowns are retained. FullRM70/E2E3/SuperMimic/270 completion remain pending; new E2 training source is active and excluded until frozen. Large binaries and raw remain producer-metadata-only for Git.\n",
